    <about>
        Klax for MiSTer — Atari Games. Set `klax4` (version 4), whose
        internal ROM test date is 20JAN1990 14:47:06; MAME dates every Klax
        set 1990 from those build stamps, though the game itself debuted in
        1989.
        ROM layout: CPU ROMs at ioctl index 0, tile ROMs at index 1,
        the factory EEPROM/NVRAM image at index 2, OKI ADPCM sample ROMs
        at index 3, and sprite ROMs at index 4. ROM parts are flat; the
        core performs the deterministic byte interleaving in RTL.
    </about>

